# Chapter: customising a theme.
#
# Settings > Theme > Dual Gauge > Customize Theme, then the panel's three tabs: accent colour and
# appearance (dark, light, auto), background, and which readout each slot shows. Auto appearance
# follows the front light sensor, which the host fakes: the scene moves the reading through a night
# and a day, and the recorder draws the backlight dimming that goes with it.
#
# Panel positions: tabs at y 50 (Theme x 85, Background x 170, Data x 246); accent swatches at
# y 102 and 132, x 70 to 247 in steps of about 44, so magenta is (70, 132); appearance buttons at
# y 168 (Dark x 86, Light x 161, Auto x 233); gradient styles at y 177 (Flat x 76, Fade x 133,
# Side x 189, Bell x 245).
title "Make it yours"
subtitle "Accent, light or dark, background and readouts, for each theme."

demo 1
boot dashboard

caption "Every theme is tunable" "Settings, Theme, then the theme you want to change. Here, Dual Gauge."
wait 1400
tap 160 120 settle=700
tap-label "SETTINGS" settle=600
tap-label "THEME" settle=800
tap-label "Dual Gauge" settle=500
caption "Customize Theme" "One panel under every preview."
tap-label "CUSTOMIZE THEME" settle=1500

caption "Accent colour" "Ten to choose from. Magenta on Dual Gauge, live as you tap."
wait 500
tap 70 132 settle=2600

caption "Light mode" "The same theme on white. Stock accents deepen to stay readable; a colour you pick stays as picked."
tap 161 168 settle=3200
caption "Dark mode" "And back."
tap 86 168 settle=1800

caption "Background" "A colour, and a gradient: flat, fade, side or bell."
tap-label "BACKGROUND" settle=1000
tap 115 132 settle=800
tap 245 177 settle=2400

caption "Readouts" "Pick what each slot shows. Volts become recovered energy."
tap-label "DATA" settle=1000
expect-label "Select a data section to customize."
tap 128 100 settle=900
tap-label "RECOVERED" settle=1800

caption "Auto" "Auto follows the front light sensor, and the backlight with it."
tap 85 50 settle=900
tap 233 168 settle=900
tap-label "ENABLE" settle=1800
caption "Dusk" "Dark mode and a dimmer display."
light 3300 28 over=3200
wait 900
caption "Daylight" "Back to light mode, full brightness."
light 250 95 over=3200
wait 1200

caption "Saved per theme" "Each theme keeps its own look. Save it and it is your dashboard."
tap 20 120 settle=700
tap 160 120 settle=3200
tap 160 120 settle=700
tap-label "SAVE" settle=1100
expect-label "SAVED"
tap-label "BACK" settle=500
tap-label "BACK" settle=500
tap-label "BACK" settle=700
wait 4200
